WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
Speaker 1: Last week I told you about two&nbsp;
Republicans who said it's too much with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:14.240
shootings. We need gun control. I'm open to an&nbsp;
assault weapons ban. That was Adam Kinzinger,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:20.560
Republican congressman who's outgoing. And New&nbsp;
York's Chris Jacobs, one of those two Republicans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:27.280
has now been so shunned by the Republican Party&nbsp;
that has withdrawn their support for him that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:33.520
he now has announced he's not going to be running&nbsp;
for reelection. That's it. You're off script and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:40.240
you're gone. So reminder, last week I did a story&nbsp;
called Multiple Republicans Changed their minds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:48.880
open to banning assault rifles. And they weren't&nbsp;
like huge lefty declarations. It was just, hey,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:55.120
you know, I've opposed these types of bans in the&nbsp;
past, but we sort of have to do something because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.120 --> 00:01:02.320
this isn't good. And one of those Republicans was&nbsp;
Chris Jacobs from New York. He is now done. Here's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:08.080
a report from the Hill. New York Republican&nbsp;
won't run for second term after backing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:13.840
gun control. Representative Chris Jacobs on Friday&nbsp;
announced he will not run for a second term in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:19.120
House. One week after breaking from his party and&nbsp;
announcing his support for an assault weapons ban.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.200
Jacobs, who represents suburbs of Buffalo, said&nbsp;
Today I'm announcing I will not run for the 23rd&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.360
Congressional District. I will finish out my time&nbsp;
as a member of Congress to the end of this year.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.480
Jacobs was endorsed by the NRA in 2020,&nbsp;
announced he would support a bill to ban&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:39.200
assault style rifles if it came to the floor. Adam&nbsp;
Kinzinger, who's retiring, said the same thing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:45.680
Jacobs also backed raising the required age for&nbsp;
specific gun sales to 21 years old. I'd say 25,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:51.760
but 21 something enacting a federal limit on gun&nbsp;
magazine capacities. I agree. And prohibiting the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:56.720
sale of body armor to the public. The New York&nbsp;
Republican told The Buffalo News in an interview&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.360
that he reconsidered his point of view toward&nbsp;
guns after the shootings in Buffalo and Uvalde,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:08.000
Texas. Make sense. Jacobs on Friday said every&nbsp;
Republican elected official who endorsed him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:14.240
in his reelection bid has withdrawn their support&nbsp;
since he backed gun control measures last week.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:18.960
He also said he lost the backing of Republican&nbsp;
committees and the Republican and conservative&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:24.400
parties in New York state. The congressman said&nbsp;
he ultimately decided to back out of the race&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:30.720
to avoid an incredibly divisive election despite&nbsp;
the backlash. I truly believe I could win,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:35.840
but it would be incredibly divisive for the party&nbsp;
and the people of the 23rd District, many of whom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:43.040
I have not ever represented. This is because the&nbsp;
redistricting would move him from the 27th to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:49.680
23rd District, saying he doesn't want a campaign&nbsp;
filled with half truths and lies. So look at that.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:56.960
He merely entertains an assault weapons ban&nbsp;
and he is excommunicated by the party and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:01.360
