will say, but David, he chose to quit. Okay. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:07.440
the message here is, if you aren't on message, we&nbsp;
all pull our support. We endorse your opponent.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:12.960
You're on your own. There's no gray area on&nbsp;
this issue. You're either on script or you are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.960 --> 00:03:22.080
